{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438822946-07a20576-c9a0-45f5-a49e-2674913d23d0.png?t=1746815306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sizzle &amp; Stack</i> is a fast-paced, card-based cooking simulator where deck-building meets restaurant chaos. Inspired by <i>Stacklands</i>, this unique twist on the culinary genre puts you in charge of a growing kitchen where every dish, upgrade, and decision is made with cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day is a new puzzle. Stack ingredients, combine tools, manage tight spaces, and serve up delicious meals to increasingly demanding customers. Whether you're prepping a simple soup or assembling a gourmet masterpiece, timing, strategy, and resource management are your secret ingredients to success.<br><br>This demo will showcase all the features, but it will conclude after a limited number of in-game days.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823013-8666a1e8-f545-47b6-acf5-9af4ee9ba524.png?t=1746815306\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823060-1cfcf676-e95d-4813-a984-1459e53fea5e.png?t=1746815306\" /><strong></strong><br> Combine ingredients, tools, and stations by stacking cards in clever ways to cook up a wide variety of dishes. Master known recipes\u2014or experiment to uncover secret ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823116-c5394aee-0152-40c2-b7cd-7a02a583b3f4.png?t=1746815306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress unlocks powerful upgrades: turn your basic <strong>Knife</strong> into a <strong>Chef\u2019s Knife</strong> for faster prep, or expand your <strong>Table</strong> to hold more cards at once. Transform your humble kitchen into a well-oiled culinary machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823165-1f3d2315-91a9-4ea3-9967-7099658f0f3c.png?t=1746815306\" /><strong></strong><br> From casual diners to stern food critics, every customer has different expectations. Keep them happy to earn tips, reputation, and rare rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823216-db5030a5-6625-41be-ab09-dfa1c08c7af7.png?t=1746815306\" /><strong></strong><br> Spend your hard-earned coins on ingredient packs with randomized cards. Expand your setup, unlock new tools, and customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823287-2b2d91a2-4906-48db-bb1a-d3fba162f1f1.png?t=1746815306\" /><strong></strong><br> Impress high-profile gourmets to earn prestigious <i>Sizzle Medals</i>\u2014unlocking powerful upgrades, new mechanics, and endgame challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823389-2db3253e-5e8a-4355-84ed-68f7266fc42f.png?t=1746815306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re just here to unwind and whip up some quick dishes or you love finding clever combos and optimizing every move, Sizzle &amp; Stack fits your vibe. Play a short day, go all-in on a long shift, or kick back in peaceful mode\u2014it\u2019s your kitchen, so run it your way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s always something new to discover, whether you\u2019re stacking for fun or cooking up a plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In <i>Sizzle &amp; Stack</i>, every card counts\u2014and every dish tells a story.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716680?t=1746815306","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716680?t=1746815306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/b1c507c6be16bef4eebbf1a583748025f42bc57f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746815306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/b1c507c6be16bef4eebbf1a583748025f42bc57f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746815306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438822946-07a20576-c9a0-45f5-a49e-2674913d23d0.png?t=1746815306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sizzle &amp; Stack</i> is a fast-paced, card-based cooking simulator where deck-building meets restaurant chaos. Inspired by <i>Stacklands</i>, this unique twist on the culinary genre puts you in charge of a growing kitchen where every dish, upgrade, and decision is made with cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day is a new puzzle. Stack ingredients, combine tools, manage tight spaces, and serve up delicious meals to increasingly demanding customers. Whether you're prepping a simple soup or assembling a gourmet masterpiece, timing, strategy, and resource management are your secret ingredients to success.<br><br>This demo will showcase all the features, but it will conclude after a limited number of in-game days.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823013-8666a1e8-f545-47b6-acf5-9af4ee9ba524.png?t=1746815306\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823060-1cfcf676-e95d-4813-a984-1459e53fea5e.png?t=1746815306\" /><strong></strong><br> Combine ingredients, tools, and stations by stacking cards in clever ways to cook up a wide variety of dishes. Master known recipes\u2014or experiment to uncover secret ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823116-c5394aee-0152-40c2-b7cd-7a02a583b3f4.png?t=1746815306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress unlocks powerful upgrades: turn your basic <strong>Knife</strong> into a <strong>Chef\u2019s Knife</strong> for faster prep, or expand your <strong>Table</strong> to hold more cards at once. Transform your humble kitchen into a well-oiled culinary machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823165-1f3d2315-91a9-4ea3-9967-7099658f0f3c.png?t=1746815306\" /><strong></strong><br> From casual diners to stern food critics, every customer has different expectations. Keep them happy to earn tips, reputation, and rare rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823216-db5030a5-6625-41be-ab09-dfa1c08c7af7.png?t=1746815306\" /><strong></strong><br> Spend your hard-earned coins on ingredient packs with randomized cards. Expand your setup, unlock new tools, and customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823287-2b2d91a2-4906-48db-bb1a-d3fba162f1f1.png?t=1746815306\" /><strong></strong><br> Impress high-profile gourmets to earn prestigious <i>Sizzle Medals</i>\u2014unlocking powerful upgrades, new mechanics, and endgame challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/extras/438823389-2db3253e-5e8a-4355-84ed-68f7266fc42f.png?t=1746815306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re just here to unwind and whip up some quick dishes or you love finding clever combos and optimizing every move, Sizzle &amp; Stack fits your vibe. Play a short day, go all-in on a long shift, or kick back in peaceful mode\u2014it\u2019s your kitchen, so run it your way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s always something new to discover, whether you\u2019re stacking for fun or cooking up a plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In <i>Sizzle &amp; Stack</i>, every card counts\u2014and every dish tells a story.</strong></p>","developers":["Arvis Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3629080","name":"Sizzle & Stack"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716680/ee6e356b109a79eb9df40a55cdb4457da9ffe106/header.jpg?t=1746815306","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135322,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135322/movie480.mp4?t=1746651239","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135322/movie_max.mp4?t=1746651239"},"name":"Sizzle & Stack Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset